<title>USA: Dycam to be delisted from AmEx.</title>
<headline>Dycam to be delisted from AmEx.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dycam Inc said it will be delisted from the American Stock Exchange because it is no longer in compliance with American Stock Exchange guidelines.</p>
<p>It said the American Stock Exchange has advised that the last day of trading of the company's common stock will be Friday, Aug. 8, 1997.</p>
